== Abstract ==

This document specifies peer-to-peer protocol changes for the [[bip-blake2b-pow.mediawiki|BLAKE2b upgrade]].
It defines the serialized version 2 block header and <code>NODE_BLAKE2B</code>, a service bit for software supporting that serialization.

