== Reference implementation ==

The reference implementation is Bitcoin Knots tag [https://github.com/bitcoinknots/bitcoin/commit/a7c4617524c334f542484bfef3919b9f12573840 v29.4.3.knots20260508], principally <code>src/primitives/block.h</code>, <code>src/protocol.h</code>, <code>src/validation.cpp</code>, <code>src/net_processing.cpp</code>, <code>src/net.cpp</code>, and <code>src/kernel/chainparams.cpp</code>.
[https://github.com/bitcoinknots/bitcoin/pull/517 Bitcoin Knots pull request #517] proposes implementing the recommendation to accept <code>NODE_BLAKE2B</code> in place of <code>NODE_WITNESS</code>.
